extends layout
include partials/pagehead

block content
  +pagehead("About Nash Luxury Realty", "We own every property we offer.", "Nash Luxury Realty buys and holds houses in established residential districts, and offers them directly to buyers and tenants.", hero)

  section.band.page
    .detail-grid
      .prose
        h2 Acquisition
        p We buy houses completed within the last few years, usually from the developer at handover or from a first owner. We look for a plot with privacy and mature planting, rooms that take daylight from more than one side, and a build we can survey fully before we commit.
        p Buying is concentrated in a small number of districts in each city. Repeat purchasing in the same streets gives us working relationships with local surveyors, contractors and managing agents, and a clear view of what a house there costs to run.
        h2 Management
        p Every house is surveyed, serviced and insured by us while we hold it. Pools, gardens, security and building systems are maintained on a set schedule, and the records are kept with the title documents.
        p Houses let on a corporate basis are furnished and serviced by our own staff. Housekeeping, included utilities and the service level are set out in the terms of each listing.
        h2 Disposal
        p Houses are offered for sale, on long lease, or on a corporate let, and in several cases on more than one basis at the same time. Nash Luxury Realty retains ownership of most of the portfolio and manages the houses it lets.
        p Price, tenure, deposit and availability are published on each listing rather than provided on request.
      aside.aside
        h2 Dealing with the owner
        p Nash Luxury Realty owns every house it markets. There is no vendor chain and no separate agency acting between you and the information you need.
        p Survey reports, title documents, floor plans and running costs are held in this office and released in full to registered clients.
        a.button(href="/portfolio") View available properties
        a.button.button-quiet(href="/register") Register

  section.band.band-rule.band-raised
    .page
      .section-head
        div
          p.eyebrow Process
          h2 From enquiry to completion
      ol.steps
        li
          div
            h3 Register your requirement
            p Registration is reviewed within two working days. Approval opens exact addresses, full terms, floor plans and supporting documentation across the portfolio.
        li
          div
            h3 Receive detailed information
            p We provide floor plans, survey reports, energy certificates where the market requires them, and running costs for any house under consideration.
        li
          div
            h3 View with the property manager
            p Viewings are arranged by appointment and accompanied by the member of staff responsible for the house.
        li
          div
            h3 Agree terms and complete
            p Reservation fees, holding deposits and first payments are taken only after written approval of your application, for a fixed amount, within a defined payment window.

  section.band.band-rule.page
    .stack
      h2 Register for early access to new releases
      p.lede Properties are often reserved before they are advertised. Registered clients are notified first.
      .button-row
        a.button(href="/register") Register
        a.button.button-quiet(href="/contact") Contact us
